078-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"絃髙","kind":"person","person_id":"v8l_ue6_un4","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p021","text":"八年，伐陸渾戎，遂至洛，觀兵於周郊。周定王使王孫滿勞楚王。楚王問鼎小大輕重，對曰：「在德不在鼎。」莊王曰：「子無阻九鼎！楚國折鉤之喙，足以爲九鼎。」王孫滿曰：「嗚呼！君王其忘之乎？昔虞夏之盛，遠方皆至，貢金九牧，鑄鼎象物，百物而爲之備，使民知神姦。桀有亂德，鼎遷於殷，載祀六百。殷紂暴虐，鼎遷於周。德之休明，雖小必重；其姦回昏亂，雖大必輕。昔成王定鼎于郟鄏，卜世三十，卜年七百，天所命也。周德雖衰，天命未改。鼎之輕重，未可問也。」楚王乃歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"周定王","kind":"person","person_id":"ima_dfc_4lp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"王孫滿","kind":"person","person_id":"fie_vij_hw2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"王孫滿","kind":"person","person_id":"fie_vij_hw2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0124","start":124,"end":125,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"殷紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0215","start":215,"end":217,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id"